  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1ff6d8c7-d774-4de9-a7c3-32800b07d647.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">沉浸式盔甲 HUD 会在现有盔甲强度条上方，向 HUD 添加关于你当前穿着的盔甲类型的信息，并显示耐久度信息，提示哪些盔甲即将破损。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_adc95858-ae19-4253-9305-8ec77c5adf63.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Txni&labelColor=36633c&color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/ImmersiveArmorHUD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Github&color=393939&labelColor=666666&style=for-the-badge&logo=Github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=393939&labelColor=fb594a&style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=393939&labelColor=33de61&style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_73cfb5b5-93f7-488c-9cb3-ed62cf86ede2.png\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">沉浸式盔甲 HUD 使用定制的微型 7x7 盔甲图标来渲染盔甲信息，这些图标设计为像素完美，并与原版进度条对齐：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_59042282-3ebb-4564-a617-3e740116df1c.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">它还能与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overflowing-bars\" rel=\"nofollow\">溢出进度条 (Overflowing Bars)</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-rpg-resource-bars\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态 RPG 资源条 (Dynamic RPG Resource Bars)</a> 等其他模组完美配合：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1228923/description_e7032f55-b3f2-442b-802c-f8abeaf735ac.png\" width=\"850\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">盔甲 HUD 条的位置和偏移量是可配置的——你可以将其切换到右侧，或手动调整 X 和 Y 坐标位置。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">该模组还提供了针对各种模组的兼容性支持，目前仅支持来自《天界 (The Aether)》的盔甲。</p>",
